From: felix07 <l.shuheng@stu.xjtu.edu.cn>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:01:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] fix(tsf): accept absent optional input scope from Windows

---
 WeaselTSF/LocalContext.h               |  56 +++--
 WeaselTSF/tests/LocalContextTest.cpp   |  69 ++++--
 WeaselTSF/tests/RealTsfContextTest.cpp | 331 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
